{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1248756-dystopia-psionics","id":1248756,"title":"Dystopia Psionics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-22T11:57:37-07:00","id":1248756,"title":"Dystopia Psionics","content":"Pardon me for putting this here but u don't see an actual forum for it and it does make use of the Storypath System. <br /> <br /> So my question is what sort of psionic powers does that game have. <br /> <br /> I was also wondering on the ease of combining the two systems if I happen to really like there psionics. <br /> <br /> I figure that few might know the answer to my questions but the email just went out and so I'm interested. <br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T12:34:28-07:00","id":1248761,"title":"","content":"I think Eddy mentioned in a Pathcast that DR psionics are different mechanically from Trinity psionics. Not sure if that makes them systemically incompatible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-22T13:52:25-07:00","id":1248770,"title":"","content":"Yes, DRE's implementation of psionics is different from Aeon's noetics. The two games have different needs and goals, and different expected power levels.<br /> <br /> If you're a DRE backer, you'll see details in the coming weeks. The first part of the manuscript is available for preview, and you'll see the rest revealed as the Kickstarter progresses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T10:19:11-07:00","id":1248873,"title":"","content":"Does this mean they aren't compatible at all, or that they just...shouldn't be &quot;doctored&quot; to be in the same game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-25T10:45:31-07:00","id":1248875,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the comments guys. <br /> <br /> The thing is while I like trinity psionics it's not how I would organize such things outside of trinity. <br /> <br /> Hence my question about the different psychic ability for a game that uses a similar set of rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-31T18:23:39-07:00","id":1250365,"title":"","content":"Random mutant powers in a post-apocalyptic setting should logically weaker than the products of a starfaring society's noetics. Comparing the setting to WoD games for a moment. Dystopian Psionics should be like the few random Garou gifts their kinfolk know. Aeon Psionic should be like Thaumuthurgy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T09:13:46-07:00","id":1251406,"title":"","content":"So has Chapter Nine psychic abilities been posted yet. I'm not a backer and I was wondering, without obviously breaking the rules, what the psychic rules are like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T12:03:55-07:00","id":1251454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1248756-dystopia-psionics?p=1251406#post1251406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So has Chapter Nine psychic abilities been posted yet. I'm not a backer and I was wondering, without obviously breaking the rules, what the psychic rules are like.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The schedule posted in a KS update says tomorrow. Then you can pledge, read it, and unpledge, if you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T05:52:05-07:00","id":1251634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1248756-dystopia-psionics?p=1251406#post1251406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So has Chapter Nine psychic abilities been posted yet. I'm not a backer and I was wondering, without obviously breaking the rules, what the psychic rules are like.</div> </div> </div> </